{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0062_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c8781f6c089863144b56ecc63489867ac07a171549899fa3473a00168b2ad1d3", "ja": "（学校に乗り込んでのシークレットライブ！　という\n冒険的な企画ライブを開催したのだが、結果は……）", "zh": "（我们举办了「闯入校园秘密演唱会！」\n这样具有冒险性的企划型演唱会，至于结果……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0062_1001_004yuk", "source_sha256": "160664222ab9ee33f83e0f7b9f17a3b7afacc628eaf16496a1f230b8ab4a5cf6", "ja": "ライブ、お疲れ様でした、{$P$}。\nお客さんがたくさん来てくれて、ほっとしましたぁ～。", "zh": "演唱会辛苦了，{$P$}。\n有好多观众来看，我真的松了一口气～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0062_1002_p", "source_sha256": "0159df195dc23f44642966ae92bd8a546413ace45c71193edc8a135f05c5c27b", "ja": "ああ、お疲れ様！　いろいろと新しい試みだったけど、\nうまく行ってよかったな。", "zh": "嗯，辛苦你了！\n这次做了许多新尝试，幸好都很顺利。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0062_1003_p", "source_sha256": "d0697c78db6efb98f71e8e2506a637dab6985740c06213fd0a3ff63381281788", "ja": "ところで、ライブ前のトークイベントで、\n雪歩、手紙を渡されそうになってたよな？", "zh": "对了，我记得演唱会前的谈话活动上，\n有人想递粉丝信给雪步对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0062_1004_004yuk", "source_sha256": "03e11f8af996621c1cb1363654b965550506b4f0feb3fe60cd3708a062fe75c0", "ja": "はう。は、はい……。でも突然だったから\nビックリしちゃって、私……受けとれなくて……。", "zh": "啊呜。是、是啊……不过事出突然我吓了一跳，\n所以我……没能收下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0062_1005_p", "source_sha256": "3014a9cd6a07716bbb084d53e5c22b52ecf6b0e8c4caed9b886ca1d6e4e0e2c1", "ja": "さっき、ファンレターBOXで見つけたんだけど……\nこの手紙がそうじゃないか？", "zh": "这是我刚才在粉丝信箱里找到的……\n是不是就是要给你的那封信？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0062_1006_004yuk", "source_sha256": "d220aec4ec61f6c4b31666df5b8ace737af1189813770db30090a73499c251ee", "ja": "あっ、それですぅ！　そのシールと、\nちょっぴり曲ってる宛名は、きっと……！", "zh": "啊，没错！看上面贴纸，\n还有有点歪歪的收件人名称，肯定不会错……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0062_1007_p", "source_sha256": "ba562ad3effe5bdce0888d6f2fbeb2e495eb257f918ad29e7c67858fdd654a8a", "ja": "やっぱりな。\nどうだ、今なら受け取れそうか？", "zh": "果然是这封。\n怎么样，现在你能收下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0062_1009_004yuk", "source_sha256": "d6fc506304062ec29a8087fe68ab863dc5ea16b47883c4be7d9ba4fba85d42d9", "ja": "はい……。さっきの私は、ダメダメでしたけど……\nあの男の子も、勇気を出してくれたはずだから……。", "zh": "可以……虽然刚才的我很不行不行……\n但那个男孩子，应该也是鼓起勇气才来的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0062_1010_004yuk", "source_sha256": "557a36ede16b1a67b37812bebb14f87c211dc35a281086ff1078e6cc10759caa", "ja": "私、きちんと読んで、それで、あの……\nちゃんと、お返事も……か、書きます～！", "zh": "我会仔细把信看过，然后，那个……\n也会好好……回、回信给他～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0062_1011_p", "source_sha256": "60228ce2532170d9e32591aa7349a260ef630da07fc0f2fbea1311537afe6c3b", "ja": "（ファンの気持ちを受け止めるのも、アイドルには\n必要なことだ。頑張ろうな、雪歩！）", "zh": "（接受粉丝的心意，对偶像来说也不可或缺。\n加油吧，雪步！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
